The Mingori family has been in the construction business for five generations. In fact, it was in 1895 that Domenico Mingori set up the first self-run construction company.

Over time, the company has specialised in the following activities:

Execution and maintenance, in particular as General Contractor, of building and plant engineering works of all kinds;
The design and engineering of general and specialist construction works in the civil, industrial and commercial fields;
Turnkey construction of any type of construction, both public and private, even of large dimensions and high quality standards;
Participation in public and private tenders in Italy and abroad.
